{"id":"vod_sn_36052","vodId":"36052","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"健康全裸系游泳部","name_cn":"健康全裸系游泳部","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/14ba9f7276e5c6af356a7cdaee537c83.jpg"},"summary":"蜷川亚室（丰崎爱生 配音）自幼生活在海边，有着了不起的游泳技术，是一个个性活泼开朗的女生。今年，她就要转入著名的县立海商高等学校开始新的学习生活了，会有怎样的好运等待着她呢？一进入学校，亚室即选择了自己热爱的游泳部，没想到，有用不的经理人兼部长冲浦要（丰永利行 配音）居然是一个连水也不敢碰的旱鸭子。　　在游泳部里，亚室认识了很多志同道合的好友：坚强好胜的织冢桃子（生天目仁美 配音），个头矮小长相幼齿的生田莳辉（清水爱 配音），表面清纯内心却十分好色的静冈魅玲（福井裕佳梨 配音）。在亚室的支持和鼓励下，冲浦要也渐渐的开始尝试从前十分恐惧的游泳运动。而他和亚室之间的关系，似乎并不是部长和部员这么简单。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/veu8ZJqPHW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F78C05YFuD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L0RYS5Ac6S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7j569nuMR21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rp0CvQ9XbX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LWcyWephK71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9N1DjQCxXV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QBQrTLkgJT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ds9wgzPF8Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A2yqpXzcEL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sh2UJZeFZ01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zkn9KTPQpr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LsC0jSTTqf1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:27.504Z"}